From c4001ca73618824055f35df76a95440bb61bee69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "charlie.day" <223032750+nchiker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:57:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Cartridge build (V2_CARTRIDGE): Leap 2.1 runtime as an
 LROS dock cartridge

make cart builds build/cart/leap_v2_cart_{home,exrom}.bin: HOME in DOCK
chunks 0-1, EXROM in chunk 6, a precompiled program image in chunk 3,
started by the stock TS2068 ROM. Every release symbol keeps its address
(tools/cart_check.py), and the release build is byte-identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
